{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19605","headline":"霜菊 · 席夔","name":"霜菊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"时令忽已变，行看被霜菊。\n可怜後时秀，当此凛风肃。\n淅沥翠枝翻，凄清金蘂馥。\n凝姿节堪重，澄艳景非淑。\n宁祛青女威，愿盈君子掬。\n持来泛罇酒，永以照幽独。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"席夔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19605.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19605","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}